  "releaseNotes": "1.1.5 — Catalog bump to whfmt.FileFormatCatalog 1.5.0 (schema v3.1, PHP/Markdown embedded language injection, CSS.whfmt fix, 856+ definitions). No CodeGen API changes — drop-in upgrade from 1.1.4. 1.1.4 — Fix JsonReaderException on Synalysis .grammar formats. 1.1.2 — Catalog 1.3.2. 1.1.1 — VB.NET output. 1.1.0 — dump command, rich types, typed exceptions.",
